<title>USA: Jacor Communications to buy NSN assets.</title>
<headline>Jacor Communications to buy NSN assets.</headline>
<dateline>COVINGTON, Ky. 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jacor Communications Inc said on Monday it reached a definitive agreement to buy the assets of NSN Network Services for $11 million in cash and stock.</p>
<p>NSN provides satellite and network services to the radio broadcasting industry.</p>
<p>Jacor owns, operates or provides programming for 130 radio stations in 27 broadcast areas.</p>
</text>
